          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mulungu wamulawaga Lahele, wazumyaga ku'lomba kwakwe, na wamutungu'laga wu'v'yazi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Lahele wav'aga na mwitungo na wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya na ku'yomba, “Gi'si' Mulungu wansini'zyaga nsoni zyanne!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho wamupaga lina mwana mwenu'yo Yosefu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Yosefu” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “anongezezye yu'ngi'.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na ku'yomba, “Gu'ku' Mulungu anongezezye mwana yu'ngi' wa ki'gosya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'damalu'ka kwamwa Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Lahele wamuv'yalaga Yosefu, Yakobo wamuwi'laga Labani ati', “Ndeku'li'le nsu'v'e ku' lu'go ku' nsi' yiswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'mpe v'aki' v'anne na v'ana v'anne av'o nav'apandi'kile ku' wu'tu'mami wanne ku' wako, ki'gele mbu'ke nav'o. Ku'nguno u'manyile i'vi naku'tu'mami'lile visoga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Labani wasu'v'yaga ati', “Hani leka nanne njombe. Nu'ku'lomba wikale du' henanha! Ku'nguno nalagu'lile na ku'manya ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu wandosizye ku'nguno yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yomba ndi'pi i'yo u'li'koov'a nanne nku'ku'li'pa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Yakobo wayombaga ati', “Ev'e mweni'ki'li' u'manyile i'vi naku'tu'mami'lile na i'vi nali' nu'zidi'ma mitugo zyako, na i'vyo zyav'age ku' wanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo i'lo nav'age nkaali' kwiza ha wako, wav'age na mitugo midoo du'hu', sumbwa ku'fuma aho nizile ha wako, Gu'ku' Mulungu waku'dosizye ku' ki'la aho nav'i'tage. Ali'vi gi'si' ene nditu'mami'le nanali' na kwiv'ezezya magambo ga nnumba yanne?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani wamuwu'zyaga ati', “Yomba u'li'koov'a nku'pe ki'?” Nawe Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ku'du' u'mpe ki'ntu'. Ali'vi u'lu' u'li'koov'a nku'di'mi'lage u'zumye i'cho nku'ku'wi'la, hu' nanne nku'zumya hangi' ku'di'ma na kwangali'la mitugo zyako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndeke walelo ningi'le mu ki'la idale, na ku'koma ki'la nkolo zya mabadomabado na zya mav'alamav'ala na ki'la nkolo nnilawu'zu na mbu'li zya mabado na zya mav'alamav'ala. Zyeni'zi hu' ziku'v'a wu'tenensya wanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha nsiku' zya mbele, aho u'lize ku'wu'lola wu'tenensya wanne ku'fuma ku' wako hu' aho lole yanne yi'ligele. Ki'la mbu'li na ki'la nkolo i'yo yi'lav'e yi'gele mabadomabado na mav'alamav'ala na nkolo i'yo yi'kav'ile nnilawu'zu yi'lav'aziwe ku'v'a nakwiv'i'laga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Labani wayombaga, “Visoga, nazumyaga na yi'v'e ki'ti' i'vyo wayombaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga lu'siku' lwene lu'lo, Labani wayaga ku'kazikoma ngulati' zyose zya machelule na mabado, na mbu'li zyose nki'ma i'zyo zyav'age na mav'alamav'ala na mabadomabado. Wazikomaga mbu'li zyose i'zyo zyav'age na wape mu muv'i'li' gwazyo, na nkolo i'zyo zyav'age na wilawu'zu mu miv'i'li' zyazyo. Zyose zyeni'zi wazitu'u'laga mu wu'su'ngi wa v'aane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Labani haki'mo na v'aane v'awu'kaga henanho na mitugo zyeni'zyo, na v'ayu'mbaga musi'nzo gwa nsiku' idatu', v'ikomaga ku'le na Yakobo. Nawe Yakobo wasigalaga ali'di'ma mitugo zyamwa Labani i'zyo zyasigali'lile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yakobo wasolaga ngito ntoto zya mulubuna, mulozi na mwalamoni. Waziku'v'aga magu'la, ki'gele gigele machelule gape mu ngito zyeni'zyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yakobo wazisolaga ngito zyeni'zyo, na ku'zikimi'ka ha mapango ga ku'nywisi'zya mitugo, aho zili'wizaga ku'nywa minzi'. Mitugo aho zizaga ku'nywa minzi' henanho ziliinaga na ku'suki'la. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga ndimu i'zyo zyasuki'laga ha mbele ya ngito zyeni'zyo, zyawu'taga mitugo zya machelule, mabado na mav'alamav'ala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Yakobo wagakomaga genago manyehe ga mitugo, na wagalingi'ki'zyaga ku' mitugo zya machelule na zya wilawu'zu ku' idale lyamwa Labani. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' Yakobo wazilekaniaga mitugo zyakwe na zyamwa Labani nawe akazisangizye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga ha itungo lya ku'liinwa mitugo migi'nu, hohene Yakobo wazikimi'kaga i'zyo ngito ha mapango ga ku'nywisi'zya ha mbele na mitugo, ki'gele zisuki'le ha mbele na ngito zyeni'zyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi akazikimi'kile ngito zyeni'zyo ha itungo lya ku'liinwa mitugo zya wu'gande. Ku'nguno yeni'yo Labani wav'aga na mitugo zya wu'gande, na Yakobo wav'aga na mitugo zya nguzu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
